    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000450', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', N'weekly_digest', N'Keigan Intelligence Report: Claims Processing (JP) (weekly digest, 2026-11-19)', '2026-11-12 12:00:00.000000', '2026-11-19 12:00:00.000000', 86, N'# Keigan Intelligence Report: Claims Processing (JP) (weekly digest, 2026-11-19)

**Health score: 86/100**

## Summary

Health score 86/100 (SLOs 50.0/50, signals 15.0/25, incidents 21.0/25). Incidents: 1 (1 x P2). Alert noise: 4 alerts reduced to 2 groups. Overall reliability is acceptable, with the open predictive signals below deserving attention this week.

## Predictive signals

- **[critical] claims-document-renderer: Memory is climbing and will reach 90% in about 1.7 days** (confidence 92%)

## SLO status

- claims-apim: Gateway availability (claims-apim): 99.923% against 99.5%, error budget left 84.5% - healthy
- claims-api: Pod readiness (claims-api): 99.907% against 99.5%, error budget left 81.4% - healthy
- claims-api: Request availability (claims-api): 99.907% against 99.5%, error budget left 81.4% - healthy
- claims-api: Request latency (claims-api): 98.459% against 95.0%, error budget left 69.2% - healthy
- claims-apim: Gateway latency (claims-apim): 98.511% against 95.0%, error budget left 70.2% - healthy
- claims-document-renderer: Pod readiness (claims-document-renderer): 99.918% against 99.5%, error budget left 83.6% - healthy
- claims-document-renderer: Request availability (claims-document-renderer): 99.918% against 99.5%, error budget left 83.6% - healthy
- claims-document-renderer: Request latency (claims-document-renderer): 98.506% against 95.0%, error budget left 70.1% - healthy
- claims-intake-func: Execution duration (claims-intake-func): 100.0% against 95.0%, error budget left 100.0% - healthy
- claims-intake-func: Execution success (claims-intake-func): 99.95% against 99.5%, error budget left 90.0% - healthy
- claims-nightly-etl: Pipeline success (claims-nightly-etl): 99.967% against 99.95%, error budget left 35.0% - healthy
- claims-sql: Successful connections (claims-sql): 99.92% against 99.5%, error budget left 84.0% - healthy
- claims-workflow: Run success (claims-workflow): 100.0% against 99.9%, error budget left 100.0% - healthy

## Incidents and noise

- 1 incident(s) in the period.
- 4 alerts were reduced to 2 groups.

## Error budget

- No incident of the week has a stated budget figure.
- Policy off: 0 breach(es) opened this week; 0 open.

## Follow-ups

- 2 open, 1 overdue, 1 done this week, 3 accepted this week.
- Overdue: Alert when container memory exceeds 80 percent of its limit (10 days, Haruto Manager)

## Runbooks

- 0 runbook(s) need attention.

## Recommendations

- Review open predictive signals with the owning teams.
