    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b3', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'assistant', N'Keigan', NULL, N'Keigan です。調査結果をここに投稿し、皆さんの議論から学びます。「Keigan, ...」と話しかけてください。インシデントが完了したら「Keigan, this is finished」と伝えるとポストモーテムを準備します。', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:30:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b5', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'assistant', N'Keigan', NULL, N'Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.', N'{"adaptiveCard": {"type": "AdaptiveCard", "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json", "version": "1.4", "body": [{"type": "TextBlock", "text": "暫定レポート", "weight": "Bolder", "size": "Medium", "color": "Accent"}, {"type": "TextBlock", "text": "Claims Processing (JP): claim submissions failing with timeouts", "wrap": true, "weight": "Bolder"}, {"type": "FactSet", "facts": [{"title": "Incident", "value": "INC004090000"}, {"title": "Priority", "value": "P2"}]}, {"type": "TextBlock", "text": "Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.", "wrap": true, "spacing": "Medium"}], "actions": [{"type": "Action.OpenUrl", "title": "Keigan で開く", "url": "http://localhost:5173/incidents/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000354"}]}}', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:30:20.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b7', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'teams_participant', N'Aiko AppAdmin', N'aiko.appadmin@keigan.local', N'調査結果を確認しました。接続プールの枯渇が原因のようです。デプロイ直後から増えていますね。', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:32:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b8', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'teams_participant', N'Rui Reader', N'rui.reader@keigan.local', N'Keigan, what changed in the last hour?', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:33:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b9', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'assistant', N'Keigan', NULL, N'Keigan identified the most likely cause.

Here is what the investigation currently says:

Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.

**Suggested fix**
Restore the previous batch import concurrency, restart the service to release saturated connections, then cap parallelism below the pool size.

**Step 1. Restore the previous batch import concurrency** (mitigate; medium risk)

Set BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM back to 4 on claims-api (it is 16 now).

Change the setting BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM on claims-api from 16 to 4.

```bash
kubectl set env deployment/claims-api -n claims BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM=4
```

This restarts the service.

This step contains values Keigan assumed and could not verify.

Check: Failed requests return to baseline.

Run the query behind [E6] again.

Expected: No failures within 10 minutes.

Undo: Set the setting back to its previous value.

Change the setting BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM on claims-api from 4 to 16.

**Step 2. Restart the service** (mitigate; medium risk)

Restart claims-api so new pods pick up the corrected configuration.

```bash
kubectl rollout restart deployment/claims-api -n claims
```

Check: Failed requests return to baseline.

Run the query behind [E6] again.

Expected: No failures within 10 minutes.

Undo: Nothing to undo: new instances start from the corrected configuration.

**Step 3. Confirm SQL sessions are falling back** (diagnose; low risk)

Confirm SQL sessions are falling back below 60 percent.

```bash
az monitor metrics list --resource ''/subscriptions/8d1c3f2a-4b6e-4c1d-9a7f-21530c1a0001/resourceGroups/RG_21530_CLMJP_PRD01/providers/Microsoft.Sql/servers/databases/claims-sql'' --metric sessions_percent --interval PT5M --aggregation Maximum
```

Expected: The maximum of sessions_percent stays below 60.

**Step 4. Cap parallelism below the pool size** (durable fix; low risk)

Size the connection pool for peak parallelism and reject configuration where parallelism exceeds the pool.

Check: Confirm the service refuses to start when parallelism exceeds the pool.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:33:05.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004ba', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'teams_participant', N'Rui Reader', N'rui.reader@keigan.local', N'I restarted the claims-api pods and increased the connection pool size to 200.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:38:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004bb', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'teams_participant', N'Aiko AppAdmin', N'aiko.appadmin@keigan.local', N'再起動後、エラー率が下がりました。顧客への影響も解消しています。', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:41:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004bc', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'teams_participant', N'Rui Reader', N'rui.reader@keigan.local', N'Keigan, this is finished', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:44:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004bd', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000004b1', N'assistant', N'Keigan', NULL, N'Understood. I am generating the postmortem draft now; it will appear in Keigan shortly.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-11-14 03:44:05.000000');
